# Dingus Quest Zero: the default aliases, added to every player's list when a game starts (the player may change or
# remove them). Each line: the word, then the verb it means. Only single words that no other rule uses, and whose
# verb's meaning does not depend on the word itself (manner, blow, maneuver, defence are read from the word, so they
# stay in the grammar). Multi-word synonyms ("take off", "put away", "pick up") stay in the grammar.
peer look
gaze look
gander look
mv walk
trundle walk
mosey walk
saunter walk
ready equip
don equip
wear equip
wield equip
remove doff
store doff
unwield doff
stow doff
leave exit
